sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Folio
    participant Chat as ChatHandler
    participant State as Redis Generation State
    participant Conversation as ConversationService
    participant MySQL
    participant Transport as ResearchHarnessTransport

    User->>Folio: Retry completed answer
    Folio->>Chat: retryGeneration(oldGenerationId, clientId)
    Chat->>State: check active generation for client
    Chat->>State: getGenerationForUser(oldGenerationId, userId)
    alt Redis snapshot exists
        State-->>Chat: snapshot + conversationRecordId
        Chat->>Conversation: prepareUserRetry with recordId
        Conversation->>MySQL: load parent by recordId + userId
    else Redis snapshot expired
        State-->>Chat: empty
        Chat->>Conversation: prepareUserRetry with generationId
        Conversation->>MySQL: load parent by generationId + userId
    end
    Conversation->>MySQL: validate completion, ownership, revision limit
    Conversation-->>Chat: ConversationRetryContext
    Chat->>State: create new generation
    Chat->>Transport: submit new job with retry context
    Transport-->>Chat: new answer completed
    Chat->>MySQL: old current=false<br/>new current=true
    Chat-->>Folio: replace the same answerSlotId
